	"data": "Module: DepthSensor (RealSense D435)\n\nTarget: Godot 4.7 (stable) · GDScript + Python sidecar · Valve Index (desktop VR)\nGoal: A loadable Core module that streams depth data from the Intel RealSense D435, renders point clouds in-engine, and writes spatial data to the shared substrate for other modules to consume.\n\nTable of Contents\nHardware & Context\nArchitecture Decision — Phased Approach\nmodule.json Manifest\nEntry Scene & Scene Tree\nPython Sidecar — Depth Stream Server\nGDScript Client —…",
